\u7909\'3f ch\'ednh (c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 ngo\'e0i c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn) c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f: \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp 50%, n\u7897\'3fp Ng
