\'3fch to\'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp, c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh\'e2n \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c ng\'e0nh c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp trong c\u7843\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. C\'e1c T\u7893
\'3fng c\'f4ng ty, Li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn n\'e0y v\u7873\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn kinh doanh cung 
\u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd t\u7921\'3f do T\u7893\'3fng c\'f4ng ty, Li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn v\'e0o ph\u7847\'3fn kinh doanh c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f
 tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f. Ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn v\'e0  tr\'edch l\u7853\'3fp qu\u7929\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7889\'3fi c\u7899\'3fi c\'e1
c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch kinh doanh th\u7913\'3f li\u7879\'3fu h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp, s\u7869\'3f c\'f3 th\'f4ng t\'fd h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn ri\'eang ./.
